# Project: TaskFlow API
# Team CLAUDE.md (applies to all developers)

## Stack
Express.js + TypeScript, PostgreSQL + Prisma, Vitest

## Conventions (enforced)
- TypeScript strict mode on all files
- Explicit return types on all exported functions
- Error handling through AppError class (src/lib/errors.ts)
- Database access only through Prisma (no raw SQL)
- API responses use ResponseShape type (src/lib/response.ts)

## File Structure (enforced)
- New routes go in src/routes/ (one file per resource)
- New services go in src/services/ (one per resource)
- New middleware goes in src/middleware/
- Tests mirror src/ structure with .test.ts suffix

## Safety (non-negotiable)
- Never modify .env files
- Never modify database migrations
- Never run git push
- Before modifying >5 files, show plan and wait for approval
- Run tests after every source file change
- Do not refactor code that isn't part of the current task

